  "description": "Build a browser game or interactive 3D toy as a single HTML file with three.js, saved in ~/Games/vibes/<name>/ and played from Game Vibes in the app launcher: arcade games, endless runners, board and card games, puzzles, visual toys, small simulations. Starts from a working template, and covers what makes a game good (feel, fairness, clarity, polish), the three.js traps older examples walk into, checking it in a headless browser, and adding it to Game Vibes. Triggers: game, make me a game, three.js, WebGL, HTML game, browser game, canvas, arcade, 3D toy, snake, asteroids, breakout, pinball, platformer, runner, maze, puzzle, chess, solitaire, minesweeper.",
